<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Venlo Guide: 11 places – market, Maas, vlaai &amp; Maasduinen – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/venlo/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>4. Sint-Martinuskerk</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Also look at the side streets around the church – it is quieter here than at the market. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/venlo/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>6.13751,51.34352,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Limburg Museum</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Perfect for a rain shower in the old town. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/venlo/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>6.1719,51.36673,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Museum van Bommel van Dam</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Combine it with a walk through the city park. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/venlo/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>6.17131,51.36743,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Shopping &amp; lanes: Vleesstraat and Lomstraat</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Plan a stroll in the morning and the break at the market at noon. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/venlo/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>6.16838,51.36875,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. De Maasduinen National Park</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Start by bike in Venlo and ride into the park – half a day is enough. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/venlo/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>6.03985,51.64272,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Arcen Castle &amp; Gardens</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come on a weekday, then it is much quieter. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/venlo/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>6.18468,51.46797,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Roermond – old town &amp; outlet</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Go on a weekday when it is calmer in the outlet and the old town. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/venlo/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>5.99385,51.19257,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
